    // DELIBERATE DEVIATION, and the honest cost of having no coroutines in this value
    // model: the body runs to COMPLETION the first time the generator is iterated,
    // collecting every yielded key/value pair into an array which the iteration then
    // walks. Creation stays lazy (nothing runs until the first foreach) and every side
    // effect happens exactly once, in order - what is lost is streaming: an unbounded
    // generator does not terminate, where real PHP would let the consumer break out.
